SAMPLE: studentCount < 5  (\"small sample\")\n- IS_RELIABLE_SAMPLE: studentCount >= 10  (\"reliable sample\")\n- IS_MODERATE_PASS: passRate between 25 50  (\"moderate pass rate\")\n- IS_PERFECT_PASS: passRate eq 100  (\"perfect pass rate\")\n- IS_NONEMPTY_CLASS: studentCount neq 0  (\"non-empty class\")\n- IS_AT_MOST_HALF: passRate lte 50  (\"at most half\")\n\nEXAMPLE:\n@[offering:10004]{3BS} has %[studentCount]{8} students with a pass rate of %[passRate]{60}%, so it is ?[p: IS_PASSING]{passing}.",
